{
 "about": "Kingdom v6, the full game: days of 60 seconds, nights of 45, five nights (about nine minutes). This is the save to hand to a person. The script plays one sensible line so that every part runs once: day 1 two citizens, the builder, a knife thrower, the wooden wall; day 2 a soldier; day 3 a second thrower and a farmer; day 4 the keep and a second soldier; day 5 a citizen who becomes the third thrower, and stone. Played by the script it is won or lost on the fourth night by seconds (three games: two won, one lost as the fourth dawn broke); a person plays differently. Its numbers are kg6_rules_play.json (smaller waves than v5, sturdier walls and soldiers, two coins more each morning: balance6.py). At night it stands between the site and the wall, where nothing offers an option and the fight can be watched. A person plays differently, and whether it is fun is for a person to say. From the third night brutes come too (火斧丘丘暴徒 with a big blade: 45 a blow, and they take five strokes).",
